{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"compression-ratio-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"compression-ratio-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["compression-ratio-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Nisbah statik adalah (volume diserbu + volum pelepasan) ÷ volum pelepasan. Volume diserbu datang dari lubang dan pukulan. Pelepasan menggabungkan bilik, kepala-gasket, dek dan piston-mahkota. Volum ZXQPH0000QXZ cc diserbu dan ZXQPH0001QXZ cc pelepasan memberikan ZXQPH0002QXZ:ZXQPH0003QXZ.","record_id":"bb557b4c2d180df5b8cd24f4c503f48bdbe237abcee596cd091a82478a87809e","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.3642728016249634,"source":"The static ratio is (swept volume + clearance volume) ÷ clearance volume. Swept volume comes from bore and stroke. Clearance combines chamber, head-gasket, deck and piston-crown volumes. A 9 cc swept volume and 1 cc clearance volume give 10:1.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"7f1b9a876212f35745c97510b1a02f7994170aa52b4d60a12f7357c7e2398c83","status":"needs-review","translation":"Nisbah statik adalah (volume diserbu + volum pelepasan) ÷ volum pelepasan. Volume diserbu datang dari lubang dan pukulan. Pelepasan menggabungkan bilik, kepala-gasket, dek dan piston-mahkota. Volum 9 cc diserbu dan 1 cc pelepasan memberikan 10:1.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
